sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Beedy
    participant L as Laptop (local repo)
    participant GH as GitHub
    actor Rev as Bob (reviewer)

    Dev->>GH: git clone <url>
    GH-->>L: full history + origin
    Dev->>L: git switch -c fix-ntp
    Dev->>L: edit ntp.py
    Dev->>L: git add ntp.py
    Dev->>L: git commit -m "Fix NTP"
    L->>GH: git push -u origin fix-ntp
    Dev->>GH: open pull request
    GH->>Rev: review request
    Rev-->>GH: approve
    GH->>GH: merge fix-ntp into main
    Dev->>L: git switch main && git pull
